{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Survey the Labyrinth</strong>, a breathing, shifting prison that rewrites itself each time you blink. The walls move with purpose. The exits dissolve as soon as you reach them. Every corridor hides a secret, and every choice drags you closer to something that has been listening since the moment you stepped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic mechanisms carved into stone older than memory. Read markings left by those who never found the way out. Move quickly, because something in the dark follows your footsteps with unnerving patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This maze is alive.<br>It studies you.<br>It adapts to you.<br>It does not want you to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the real path\u2026 or become another whisper lost in its endless, hungry corridors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432290?t=1773705284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432290?t=1773705284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432290/d0c89d48e1cdb6f3922f629bf7b12824377cf5e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773705284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432290/d0c89d48e1cdb6f3922f629bf7b12824377cf5e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773705284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Survey the Labyrinth</strong>, a breathing, shifting prison that rewrites itself each time you blink. The walls move with purpose. The exits dissolve as soon as you reach them. Every corridor hides a secret, and every choice drags you closer to something that has been listening since the moment you stepped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic mechanisms carved into